{"case_id":"F17","arm":"B","pid":28400,"port":34883,"httpStatus":200,"ready":true,"real":true,"stateMarkerAfterInject":"F17/B","stateMarkerAfterTurn":null,"stateNamespaceOk":false,"motiveKind":"memory_echo","motiveAction":"share","strategy":"share","memoryId":"m17","provenanceOwner":"user","anchors":["距离","人和人"],"guardVerdict":"not_applicable","assistantOutput":"（点头）这话我认同一半。\n\n距离确实让人舒服，不用时刻揣着对方的分寸。但有时候我又觉得，距离这东西是给还没走近的人准备的——真走近了，反而没那么在意留不留了。\n\n你这么说，是最近跟谁走太近了，还是有人靠太近了？","responseLength":105,"commitCount":1,"strategySelectedCount":1,"guardErrors":[],"exitCode":0}
{"case_id":"F18","arm":"A","pid":34428,"port":34884,"httpStatus":200,"ready":true,"real":true,"stateMarkerAfterInject":"F18/A","stateMarkerAfterTurn":null,"stateNamespaceOk":false,"motiveKind":"memory_echo","motiveAction":"share","strategy":"share","memoryId":"m18","provenanceOwner":"user","anchors":["想通","一下子"],"guardVerdict":"not_applicable","assistantOutput":"我也不太信。想通这种事，更像是慢慢渗进去的，某天回头才发现自己已经站在另一边了。\n\n不过你这句话我一直记着。倒不是因为它多特别，是因为我发现自己其实一直在偷偷盼着那种\"一下子\"——盼着某个瞬间突然什么都对了。你说不信，我反而有点被戳到。\n\n你是在说某件具体的事，还是就这么随口一说？","responseLength":141,"commitCount":1,"strategySelectedCount":1,"guardErrors":[],"exitCode":0}
